FUN_0000_1cdb: cursor node-list near offset (fe04) computed from the host symbol address.

asm 0x1d22 sets fe04 = word[0x3afa] + 0x3af0 (a DGROUP near offset).  Ghidra rendered &DAT_1000_faf0 as
the HOST address (g_mem+0x1faf0), so the 16-bit store truncated to garbage (0xabe0) that FUN_0000_201a
then walked as a bogus DGROUP offset (SIGSEGV).  Use the near offset 0x3af0.  Asm-verified engine 0x1cdb.
