+     garbage 16-bit value (e.g. 0xabe0) that FUN_0000_201a then walked as a bogus DGROUP offset.
+     asm 0x1d22: `mov ax,ds:0x3afa; add ax,0x3af0; mov ds:0x3e04,ax` (param_4 == word[0x3afa]).  Use
